## 📋 Deployment Checklist

```
[ ] Remove backend/server_log.txt from git
[ ] Clean up or remove Supabase keys from frontend/.env
[ ] Set real secrets via deployment platform (not in .env files)
[ ] Remove 'unsafe-inline' from CSP or use nonces
[ ] Remove MongoDB/Redis port exposure in docker-compose
[ ] Configure nginx with HTTPS + real domain
[ ] Fix X-Frame-Options conflict (Helmet vs nginx)
[ ] Add Unsplash/Google to CSP imgSrc
[ ] Run `npm run build` to verify production bundle
[ ] Delete or move stale test scripts
[ ] Add Axios request timeout
```
